{"product_id":"all-you-need-is-kill","title":"All You Need Is Kill","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThey call it a war humanity cannot win. Keiji Kiriya is just another recruit sent to fight an alien invasion, armed with heavy battle armor and little hope. But when he dies on the battlefield and wakes up the day before, he’s forced to live the same fight again and again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"417\"\u003eEvery death resets the clock. Every battle teaches him something new. And every loop brings him closer to becoming the soldier who might change the fate of humanity. But escaping the time loop will take more than skill—it will take facing the truth behind the endless war.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"693\"\u003eThe explosive novel that inspired the blockbuster film Edge of Tomorrow, All You Need Is Kill is a relentless, mind-bending mix of military science fiction, action, and heart-stopping tension.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1040\" data-start=\"889\"\u003eProduct details:\u003cbr data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"905\"\u003eAuthor: Hiroshi Sakurazaka\u003cbr data-end=\"968\" data-start=\"965\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"985\"\u003eISBN: \u003cbr data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"1011\"\u003ePages: \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45732500996249,"sku":"11RA9781421576015","price":30.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/71g40Nm276L._AC_UL600_SR600_600.jpg?v=1758273104","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/all-you-need-is-kill","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}